synopsis:
  Fix a segfault that could occur when a bottoming function was stored in a strict field.
description:
  This was happening when a function that always diverges (e.g. ``\_ -> error "..."``) was stored in a strict field, and the constructor was pattern matched on
  in "nearby" code where the structure of the constructor application was still visible to GHC.
